#'       handling, exact rounding) relative to a standard-compliant build.}
#'     \item{eigen_dont_vectorize_macro}{Logical; \code{TRUE} iff
#'       \code{EIGEN_DONT_VECTORIZE} was defined, disabling Eigen's SIMD
#'       vectorization for this build (e.g. for portability to CPUs lacking the
#'       vector instructions a native build would target).}
#'   }
